          </h2>
          <p className="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1" style={{ fontSize: '12px', color: '#64748b', marginTop: '4px', margin: 0 }}>
            Immutable version history with optimistic lock tracking and lifecycle state.
          </p>
        </div>
        <button
          type="button"
          onClick={onCreateDraft}
